        "text": "To map a shared network drive:\n\n**Windows**\n1. Open **File Explorer**.\n2. Right-click **This PC** → **Map network drive**.\n3. Choose a drive letter.\n4. Enter the folder path, e.g. `\\\\server\\share`.\n5. Check **Reconnect at sign-in** if needed.\n6. Click **Finish** and sign in with your company credentials if prompted.\n\n**macOS**\n1. Open **Finder**.\n2. Press **Cmd + K** or choose **Go → Connect to Server**.\n3. Enter the address, e.g. `smb://server/share`.\n4. Click **Connect** and authenticate if prompted.\n\nIf you don’t know the server/share path or access is denied, open an IT ticket with the team/shared drive name you need.",
        "mediaUrl": null
      }
